= 1928

The new year. In the recent years, economy has seen rise even though unemployment remains high, however bürgerblock is facing the crisis over the School Law, legislation which would guarantee the fundamental equality of interdenominational, confessional and secular schools. However, DVP protests it, arguing against the influence of church and for securing the primacy of interdenominational schools.

It does not look like it will last long.
